   "**Two crashes on one line in ten months is a finding, not a coincidence** — 46 dead in January, 69 in October, same corridor; the direct effect is that the corridor's safety case must now be treated as failed until proven otherwise; the compound consequence is that a network which halts all trains on a computer fault and then clears one of them is a network whose fail-safe state is a queue of trains in the dark — and a queue is exactly what a control centre is under pressure to clear",
